WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Twelve minutes feels possible when an hour does not.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But a shorter format is different from proof of an equivalent result.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Zen12 describes twelve levels and four listening styles.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Those are package details, not evidence that it treats a condition.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Test a free twelve-minute routine. Decide what matters to you.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Then check the exact offer and refund terms before spending.
